{"2990190":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Magi Scapes","steam_appid":2990190,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[4967310],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of building alone in sandbox worlds? Bored of NPCs who just repeat the same scripted lines? Welcome to <strong>Magi Scapes<\/strong>!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cozy pixel-art world, you'll meet AI companions with unique personalities, or create the one you've always imagined. Explore the mysterious continent of Oz, take on challenging bosses, and build a home together. A whole new life awaits you and your companions~<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/57b34b02985ff84d8c9b324526aa73f2.poster.avif?t=1793239208\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/57b34b02985ff84d8c9b324526aa73f2.webm?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/57b34b02985ff84d8c9b324526aa73f2.mp4?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Gameplay<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/e8850459cfc8b3f3895ac75f15775a60.avif?t=1793239208\" width=600 height=100 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What kind of companion do you want? It's entirely up to you!<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use text or images to describe their appearance, personality, way of speaking, backstory, and even life goals.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a lover who seems cold but has a soft heart, or a sharp-tongued partner who's always ready to fight by your side. The AI brings your ideas to life, giving each character their own personality and story.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character also comes with a unique ID code. Share your creations with friends, or use codes from other players to bring their characters into your world and start new adventures together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/6117501835857a0af248bf201bc347b5.poster.avif?t=1793239208\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/6117501835857a0af248bf201bc347b5.webm?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/6117501835857a0af248bf201bc347b5.mp4?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/f69c6581cea236dd596b6e92614cbd4c.avif?t=1793239208\" width=600 height=100 \/><\/span>      <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here, NPCs aren't bound by fixed scripts. They're living companions whose behavior, attitudes, and relationships evolve through your interactions.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat freely, give gifts, and go on adventures together to grow closer. But be careful! Do something they dislike, and they might just give you the cold shoulder!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every NPC has their own personality and way of life. A lazy companion might sleep all day, while a battle-loving one could spend hours hunting. Take them exploring, and they'll react to their surroundings and share their thoughts based on their personalities.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/118eb6aa03f0b98e0877b688b368a6cf.avif?t=1793239208\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras_big\/118eb6aa03f0b98e0877b688b368a6cf.avif?t=1793239208 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And your companions have social lives of their own!<\/strong> They'll gradually get to know each other, chat while traveling in the same party, and you can even invite everyone over for a meal together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town is also home to a cast of unique AI residents, each with their own routines, relationships, and stories waiting to be discovered.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/23cd126f926e12ff4b7316e15fd82d7d.poster.avif?t=1793239208\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/23cd126f926e12ff4b7316e15fd82d7d.webm?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/23cd126f926e12ff4b7316e15fd82d7d.mp4?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/3f1ea39910d944008e9e2e243fdedcc6.avif?t=1793239208\" width=600 height=100 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As your bond grows stronger, you'll unlock personal stories unique to each companion.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach new relationship milestones to unlock AI-generated quests based on your companion's backstory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps you'll help a mechanic find their long-lost sister, or help a traveler come to terms with their past...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete these quests to earn unique <strong>AI-generated items<\/strong>! Each comes with its own name and special effects, and some can even give you a powerful boost in combat!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/a7ca3a8c84c1309ba99a167f795e0900.avif?t=1793239208\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras_big\/a7ca3a8c84c1309ba99a167f795e0900.avif?t=1793239208 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/ce9df6dc8b0609ca746ef18547655dcb.avif?t=1793239208\" width=600 height=100 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, construct buildings, and decorate your home as you turn an empty patch of land into a cozy camp for you and your companions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow magical plants, cultivate unique mutations, go fishing, cook delicious meals, and spend time with adorable creatures. Enjoy the simple pleasures of sandbox life!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/fa93fff1dc289910204b9a35d657dad9.poster.avif?t=1793239208\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/fa93fff1dc289910204b9a35d657dad9.webm?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/fa93fff1dc289910204b9a35d657dad9.mp4?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And you don't have to do everything yourself!<\/strong> The AI assigns different life skills to each companion based on their character settings. Whether it's farming, mining, cooking, or alchemy, your companions can put their skills to work and help you build a thriving home.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/863c87cca3b0ce34828bf0263f55d94c.poster.avif?t=1793239208\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/863c87cca3b0ce34828bf0263f55d94c.webm?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/863c87cca3b0ce34828bf0263f55d94c.mp4?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your camp is also your base of operations. Stock up on resources, craft equipment, and build mechanical devices to prepare for your next expedition into the mines, boss battle, or journey into the unknown.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/90af58e0a09e8e9b454809a20b472049.avif?t=1793239208\" width=600 height=100 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse biomes, from swamps and plains to snowy landscapes and vast deserts. Each region has its own ecosystem, resources, wildlife, and challenges.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by Unreal Engine 5, natural lighting and dynamic weather bring the pixel-art world to life, making every journey feel more immersive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/65790a9a1235b4770ec0d2d215f7ab9e.poster.avif?t=1793239208\" width=1170 height=576 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/65790a9a1235b4770ec0d2d215f7ab9e.webm?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/65790a9a1235b4770ec0d2d215f7ab9e.mp4?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond free exploration, the continent of Oz has its own main storyline and plenty of side quests. Venture into underground mines, explore ancient ruins, discover hidden treasures, or form a party with your AI companions to take on powerful bosses together!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost your way? Can't find the resources you need? Just ask your AI companions!<\/strong> If they know where to go, they can actually lead you straight to your destination.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/7d5a81e9cb034d71abe55ad8ed5c6888.poster.avif?t=1793239208\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/7d5a81e9cb034d71abe55ad8ed5c6888.webm?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/7d5a81e9cb034d71abe55ad8ed5c6888.mp4?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >「About Crystals &amp; Optional In-Game Purchases」<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magi Scapes is a buy-to-play game. Purchasing the base game gives you access to all core content available during Early Access, without needing to buy additional Crystals.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The base game includes 2,400 Crystals and one free character creation, allowing you to create 4 original AI NPCs in total.<\/strong> Crystals are mainly used to create or recruit additional AI NPCs, as well as for the optional TTS (text-to-speech) feature. <strong>Once an NPC is created, AI conversations, AI quests, and AI items do not cost any additional Crystals.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When using the official AI service, you can have up to 10 back-and-forth exchanges per in-game day (about 20 minutes in real time). You can also advance to the next in-game day by sleeping.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you'd like to create more AI NPCs, you can purchase additional Crystals through the in-game store or DLC. We'll also regularly host community events where players can receive free Crystals.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/6c2fda0aca73bdd33226e228af6de4d7.avif?t=1793239208\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras_big\/6c2fda0aca73bdd33226e228af6de4d7.avif?t=1793239208 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchasing additional Crystals is not required to enjoy the game's core content. They're simply an optional way for players who want to create more characters to do so.<\/strong><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of building alone in sandbox worlds? Bored of NPCs who just repeat the same scripted lines? Welcome to <strong>Magi Scapes<\/strong>!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this cozy pixel-art world, you'll meet AI companions with unique personalities, or create the one you've always imagined. Explore the mysterious continent of Oz, take on challenging bosses, and build a home together. A whole new life awaits you and your companions~<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/57b34b02985ff84d8c9b324526aa73f2.poster.avif?t=1793239208\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/57b34b02985ff84d8c9b324526aa73f2.webm?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/57b34b02985ff84d8c9b324526aa73f2.mp4?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Gameplay<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/e8850459cfc8b3f3895ac75f15775a60.avif?t=1793239208\" width=600 height=100 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What kind of companion do you want? It's entirely up to you!<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use text or images to describe their appearance, personality, way of speaking, backstory, and even life goals.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a lover who seems cold but has a soft heart, or a sharp-tongued partner who's always ready to fight by your side. The AI brings your ideas to life, giving each character their own personality and story.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character also comes with a unique ID code. Share your creations with friends, or use codes from other players to bring their characters into your world and start new adventures together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/6117501835857a0af248bf201bc347b5.poster.avif?t=1793239208\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/6117501835857a0af248bf201bc347b5.webm?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/6117501835857a0af248bf201bc347b5.mp4?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/f69c6581cea236dd596b6e92614cbd4c.avif?t=1793239208\" width=600 height=100 \/><\/span>      <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here, NPCs aren't bound by fixed scripts. They're living companions whose behavior, attitudes, and relationships evolve through your interactions.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat freely, give gifts, and go on adventures together to grow closer. But be careful! Do something they dislike, and they might just give you the cold shoulder!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every NPC has their own personality and way of life. A lazy companion might sleep all day, while a battle-loving one could spend hours hunting. Take them exploring, and they'll react to their surroundings and share their thoughts based on their personalities.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/118eb6aa03f0b98e0877b688b368a6cf.avif?t=1793239208\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras_big\/118eb6aa03f0b98e0877b688b368a6cf.avif?t=1793239208 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And your companions have social lives of their own!<\/strong> They'll gradually get to know each other, chat while traveling in the same party, and you can even invite everyone over for a meal together.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The town is also home to a cast of unique AI residents, each with their own routines, relationships, and stories waiting to be discovered.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/23cd126f926e12ff4b7316e15fd82d7d.poster.avif?t=1793239208\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/23cd126f926e12ff4b7316e15fd82d7d.webm?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/23cd126f926e12ff4b7316e15fd82d7d.mp4?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/3f1ea39910d944008e9e2e243fdedcc6.avif?t=1793239208\" width=600 height=100 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As your bond grows stronger, you'll unlock personal stories unique to each companion.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach new relationship milestones to unlock AI-generated quests based on your companion's backstory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perhaps you'll help a mechanic find their long-lost sister, or help a traveler come to terms with their past...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete these quests to earn unique <strong>AI-generated items<\/strong>! Each comes with its own name and special effects, and some can even give you a powerful boost in combat!<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/a7ca3a8c84c1309ba99a167f795e0900.avif?t=1793239208\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras_big\/a7ca3a8c84c1309ba99a167f795e0900.avif?t=1793239208 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/ce9df6dc8b0609ca746ef18547655dcb.avif?t=1793239208\" width=600 height=100 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources, construct buildings, and decorate your home as you turn an empty patch of land into a cozy camp for you and your companions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow magical plants, cultivate unique mutations, go fishing, cook delicious meals, and spend time with adorable creatures. Enjoy the simple pleasures of sandbox life!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/fa93fff1dc289910204b9a35d657dad9.poster.avif?t=1793239208\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/fa93fff1dc289910204b9a35d657dad9.webm?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/fa93fff1dc289910204b9a35d657dad9.mp4?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And you don't have to do everything yourself!<\/strong> The AI assigns different life skills to each companion based on their character settings. Whether it's farming, mining, cooking, or alchemy, your companions can put their skills to work and help you build a thriving home.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/863c87cca3b0ce34828bf0263f55d94c.poster.avif?t=1793239208\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/863c87cca3b0ce34828bf0263f55d94c.webm?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/863c87cca3b0ce34828bf0263f55d94c.mp4?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your camp is also your base of operations. Stock up on resources, craft equipment, and build mechanical devices to prepare for your next expedition into the mines, boss battle, or journey into the unknown.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/90af58e0a09e8e9b454809a20b472049.avif?t=1793239208\" width=600 height=100 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse biomes, from swamps and plains to snowy landscapes and vast deserts. Each region has its own ecosystem, resources, wildlife, and challenges.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Powered by Unreal Engine 5, natural lighting and dynamic weather bring the pixel-art world to life, making every journey feel more immersive.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/65790a9a1235b4770ec0d2d215f7ab9e.poster.avif?t=1793239208\" width=1170 height=576 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/65790a9a1235b4770ec0d2d215f7ab9e.webm?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/65790a9a1235b4770ec0d2d215f7ab9e.mp4?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond free exploration, the continent of Oz has its own main storyline and plenty of side quests. Venture into underground mines, explore ancient ruins, discover hidden treasures, or form a party with your AI companions to take on powerful bosses together!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost your way? Can't find the resources you need? Just ask your AI companions!<\/strong> If they know where to go, they can actually lead you straight to your destination.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/7d5a81e9cb034d71abe55ad8ed5c6888.poster.avif?t=1793239208\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/7d5a81e9cb034d71abe55ad8ed5c6888.webm?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/7d5a81e9cb034d71abe55ad8ed5c6888.mp4?t=1793239208\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >「About Crystals &amp; Optional In-Game Purchases」<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magi Scapes is a buy-to-play game. Purchasing the base game gives you access to all core content available during Early Access, without needing to buy additional Crystals.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The base game includes 2,400 Crystals and one free character creation, allowing you to create 4 original AI NPCs in total.<\/strong> Crystals are mainly used to create or recruit additional AI NPCs, as well as for the optional TTS (text-to-speech) feature. <strong>Once an NPC is created, AI conversations, AI quests, and AI items do not cost any additional Crystals.<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When using the official AI service, you can have up to 10 back-and-forth exchanges per in-game day (about 20 minutes in real time). You can also advance to the next in-game day by sleeping.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you'd like to create more AI NPCs, you can purchase additional Crystals through the in-game store or DLC. We'll also regularly host community events where players can receive free Crystals.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras\/6c2fda0aca73bdd33226e228af6de4d7.avif?t=1793239208\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/extras_big\/6c2fda0aca73bdd33226e228af6de4d7.avif?t=1793239208 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchasing additional Crystals is not required to enjoy the game's core content. They're simply an optional way for players who want to create more characters to do so.<\/strong><\/p>","short_description":"A pixel-art sandbox with deeply customizable AI NPCs. Build, farm, explore, and fight together. Here, companionship is more than just conversation.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2990190\/52ccd5ac82c2d68848f66bce4e12a53c8b38e883\/header.jpg?t=1793239208","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/29